CLKC-58#1 Advisory
PLLE4 with global clock driver has no LOC  
The PLLE4_ADV cell native_pll_bank61 CLKIN pin is driven by global Clock buffer BUFG_1 and does not have a LOC constraint. It is recommended to LOC the PLL and use the CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE constraint on the net driven by the global Clock buffer.
Related violations: <none>

